# Vulnerabilities accepted for the CI Trivy scan (NF-11.10), one ID per line.
# Use only when a fix exists but the upgrade is blocked. Each entry needs a
# comment with the reason, a link to the blocking issue, and a review date;
# remove it as soon as the upgrade lands. For example:
#
# # Blocked by <link>; review 2026-12-01.
# CVE-2026-12345
